Status
------
As of 8 November 2026 this repository contains design documents only. No code
from any other project has been copied yet. The entries below record what the
plan says will be brought in, so the obligations are known in advance.

Lineage (to be seeded at milestone S0)
--------------------------------------
- FART-next, the predecessor control centre (GPL-3.0). It descends from
  pctrade/end4-pC and end-4/dots-hyprland ("illogical-impulse"), both GPL-3.0,
  and includes a Caelestia shell asset (GPL-3.0). FART-next's own NOTICE lists
  the derived files. That NOTICE will be carried over in full, and the seed
  commit will be recorded here.

Planned third-party use
-----------------------
- DMS, Dux Modular Shell (formerly DankMaterialShell),
  https://github.com/duxlabs-dev/dux-shell
  MIT licence, "Copyright (c) 2025 Avenge Media LLC".
  The `dms` backend is installed separately and used over its socket; it is not
  vendored. If any of its QML services are adapted (notifications, lock/PAM,
  idle, polkit), the MIT notice will be reproduced here, with each derived file
  listed.
- Yale Bright Star Catalogue (public domain) for the sky. Confirmed at
  milestone S8.

Read at runtime, not distributed
--------------------------------
- Serpantinum: colour presets, UI sounds, emoji data and the `serpantinum` PAM
  service file are read from the owner's local installation when present. No
  licence file was found in that installation, so none of these files are
  copied into this repository.

Design references
-----------------
Persona and NieR:Automata are named only as design inspiration. No names,
logos, fonts, artwork, sounds or layouts from them are used.
